WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.120
Let's show how to add a pair of engines. Go to Add to My Collection.

2
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:11.580
We'll do a 2378 Milwaukee Road diesel.

3
00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:17.880
It's an AB set. I have the ones with the yellow stripe.

4
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:23.110
That's version one. My B unit is an eight.

5
00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:25.680
I believe my A unit is a seven.

6
00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:28.680
I'm going to view them on COTT.

7
00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:32.580
There they are. Looks pretty good.

8
00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:37.840
Let's research it real quick.

9
00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:43.810
It says $1,350 to $1,700.

10
00:00:46.610 --> 00:00:48.310
I'll put mine in at $1,700.

11
00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:52.080
I paid a thousand,

12
00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:56.010
at the York train show. I forgot what the date was,

13
00:00:56.060 --> 00:00:57.660
so we'll just go with today's date.

14
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.280
It's in my train room.

15
00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:02.240
We'll hit Next.

16
00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:05.080
We'll add a picture from my photos.

17
00:01:06.850 --> 00:01:08.970
Scroll down real quick.

18
00:01:09.410 --> 00:01:12.650
There she is. Hit Done.

19
00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:16.210
It uploads. I want to crop it.

20
00:01:18.150 --> 00:01:27.140
Rotate it, because I took a terrible picture. Looks good.

21
00:01:28.020 --> 00:01:29.780
Apply crop.

22
00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:32.140
Hit Next.

23
00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:34.660
This is for the B unit.

24
00:01:35.950 --> 00:01:38.050
Do the same thing.

25
00:01:41.970 --> 00:01:45.730
There she is. Hit Done.

26
00:01:58.230 --> 00:02:00.900
Hit Next. Now the set together.

27
00:02:00.950 --> 00:02:08.120
Let's go down.

28
00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:23.480
There's the set. Looks pretty good there.

29
00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:33.530
She's loaded. Hit Next. Now I can check my details.

30
00:02:34.640 --> 00:02:38.280
That all looks really good, and I hit Save.

31
00:02:39.890 --> 00:02:42.330
As you can see, here it is.

32
00:02:42.670 --> 00:02:44.670
We click on the detail sheet.

33
00:02:44.990 --> 00:02:46.730
You can scroll down.

34
00:02:50.340 --> 00:02:52.180
It's a pretty good-looking set.

